msgid "freeAudio"
msgstr "freeAudio"

#. Translators: Spoken when no audio output devices could be found on the system at all.
#. Translators: Spoken when no output devices are found while setting up audio mirroring.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:57
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:191
msgid "No audio output devices found"
msgstr "រកមិនឃើញឧបករណ៍បញ្ចេញសំឡេងទេ"

#. Translators: Spoken instead of showing a picker, when only one physical audio output device exists.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:63
msgid ""
"Only one physical audio output device is available. freeAudio uses the "
"system default output."
msgstr "មានឧបករណ៍បញ្ចេញសំឡេងតែមួយប៉ុណ្ណោះ។ freeAudio ប្រើលទ្ធផលលំនាំដើមរបស់ប្រព័ន្ធ។"

#. Translators: First entry in the output-device list; means 'use whatever Windows currently has as its default output'.
#. Translators: Same meaning as 'System default' above; label shown when announcing the currently active output device.
#. Translators: Same 'System default' first-entry convention as the main output-device picker (see audioDeviceMixin.py), used here to populate this dialog's own device list.
#. Translators: Same 'System default' first-entry convention as the other device pickers, used here to populate the Settings panel's device list.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:71
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:159
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:95
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:1710
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:655
msgid "System default"
msgstr "លំនាំដើមប្រព័ន្ធ"

#. Translators: Prompt of the dialog listing devices to choose as freeAudio's main playback output.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:96
msgid "Select the main output device:"
msgstr "ជ្រើសរើសឧបករណ៍បញ្ចេញសំឡេងសំខាន់៖"

#. Translators: Title of the dialog for choosing freeAudio's main output device.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:98
msgid "freeAudio Output Device"
msgstr "ឧបករណ៍បញ្ចេញសំឡេង freeAudio"

#. Translators: Spoken when switching the main output device fails; %s is the device name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:123
#, python-format
msgid "Could not switch to output device: %s"
msgstr "មិនអាចប្តូរទៅឧបករណ៍បញ្ចេញសំឡេង៖ %s"

#. Translators: Spoken after successfully switching the main output device; %s is the device name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:161
#, python-format
msgid "Output device: %s"
msgstr "ឧបករណ៍បញ្ចេញសំឡេង៖ %s"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command in the Input Gestures dialog; starts/stops simultaneously playing audio through a second output device.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:165
msgid "Mirror audio to an additional output device"
msgstr "ចម្លងសំឡេងទៅឧបករណ៍បន្ថែមខាងក្រៅ"

#. Translators: Spoken when audio mirroring to a secondary device is turned off.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:174
msgid "Audio mirror stopped"
msgstr "ការចម្លងសំឡេងបានបញ្ឈប់ហើយ"

#. Translators: Spoken if the user tries to start audio mirroring while nothing is playing.
#. Translators: Spoken when the delayed single-press action fires and finds nothing is playing.
#. Translators: Spoken when the double-press (song-capture) gesture is used while nothing is playing.
#. Translators: Spoken when this shortcut is pressed while nothing is playing.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:179
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\recordingMixin.py:116
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\recordingMixin.py:238
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\__init__.py:1023
msgid "No station is playing"
msgstr "មិនមានប៉ុស្តិ៍ណាមួយកំពុងចាក់ទេ"

#. Translators: Prompt of the dialog for choosing the secondary (mirror) output device.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:206
msgid "Select additional output device for audio mirror:"
msgstr "ជ្រើសរើសឧបករណ៍បញ្ចេញសំឡេងបន្ថែមសម្រាប់ការចម្លងសំឡេង:"

#. Translators: Title of the dialog for choosing the secondary mirror output device.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:208
msgid "Mirror Audio"
msgstr "ចម្លងសំឡេង"

#. Translators: Spoken once mirroring to the chosen secondary device starts successfully; %s is the device name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:237
#, python-format
msgid "Mirroring to: %s"
msgstr "កំពុងចម្លងសំឡេងទៅកាន់: %s"

#. Translators: Spoken when starting the audio mirror to the chosen device fails; %s is the device name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:240
#, python-format
msgid "Could not mirror to: %s"
msgstr "មិនអាចចម្លងសំឡេងទៅកាន់: %s"

#. Translators: Spoken automatically when the user's selected output device is unplugged; freeAudio has fallen back to the system default.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:273
msgid "Audio device disconnected. Switched to system default."
msgstr "ឧបករណ៍បញ្ចេញសំឡេងត្រូវបានផ្តាច់។ បានប្តូរទៅលំនាំដើមនៃប្រព័ន្ធ។"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; raises freeAudio's playback volume by 5 (of 200 max, capped at 100 when saved).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:33
msgid "Increase freeAudio volume by 5"
msgstr "បង្កើនសំឡេង freeAudio ៥ ចំណុច"

#. Translators: Spoken after volume is changed with the volume-up/down commands; %d is the new volume level.
#. Translators: Spoken after volume is changed; %d is the new volume level.
#. Translators: Spoken when F5 (volume down) is pressed inside the dialog; %d is the new volume level. Same wording as the main volumeDown NVDA command.
#. Translators: Spoken when F6 (volume up) is pressed inside the dialog; %d is the new volume level. Same wording as the main volumeUp NVDA command.
#. Translators: Spoken when Ctrl+Up (volume up) is pressed inside the dialog on a focused control that doesn't otherwise handle it; %d is the new volume level. Same wording as the main volumeUp NVDA command.
#. Translators: Spoken when Ctrl+Down (volume down) is pressed inside the dialog; %d is the new volume level. Same wording as the main volumeDown NVDA command.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:42
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:56
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:4079
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:4093
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:4274
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:4282
#, python-format
msgid "Volume %d"
msgstr "កម្រិតសំឡេង %d"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; lowers freeAudio's playback volume by 5.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:47
msgid "Decrease freeAudio volume by 5"
msgstr "បន្ថយសំឡេង freeAudio ៥ ចំណុច"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; speeds up playback rate, podcasts/audiobooks/GETEM chapters only.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:61
msgid "Increase podcast playback speed"
msgstr "បង្កើនល្បឿនចាក់ផតខាស់"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; slows down playback rate, podcasts/audiobooks/GETEM chapters only.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:70
msgid "Decrease podcast playback speed"
msgstr "បន្ថយល្បឿនចាក់ផតខាស់"

#. Translators: Spoken when the playback-rate command returns the rate to normal (1.0x).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:81
msgid "Rate normal"
msgstr "ល្បឿនធម្មតា"

#. Translators: Spoken after changing playback rate; %.1f is the new rate, e.g. '1.5' meaning 1.5x speed.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:84
#, python-format
msgid "Rate %.1f"
msgstr "ល្បឿន %.1f"

#. Translators: Spoken when playback-rate change fails because the optional bass_fx library used for time-stretching isn't installed.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:88
msgid ""
"Playback speed control needs the bass_fx add-on library — see the freeAudio "
"docs."
msgstr "ការគ្រប់គ្រងល្បឿនចាក់ត្រូវការបណ្ណាល័យបន្ថែម bass_fx — សូមមើលឯកសារ freeAudio។"

#. Translators: Spoken when the user tries to change playback rate while playing a live radio station rather than a podcast/audiobook.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:91
msgid "Playback speed control is only available for podcasts."
msgstr "ការគ្រប់គ្រងល្បឿនចាក់មានសម្រាប់តែផតខាស់ប៉ុណ្ណោះ។"

#. Translators: Generic fallback spoken when the playback-rate change fails for an unrecognised reason.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:94
msgid "Could not change playback speed."
msgstr "មិនអាចផ្លាស់ប្តូរល្បឿនចាក់បានទេ។"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; toggles a low-frequency EQ boost on/off.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:132
msgid "Toggle bass boost"
msgstr "បើក/បិទ ការបង្កើនស្តើងទាប (bass boost)"

#. Translators: Short label used in the 'X enabled/disabled' announcement (see _toggle_eq_band) when toggling the bass-boost EQ band.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:138
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:778
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:181
msgid "EQ: Bass Boost"
msgstr "EQ: Bass Boost"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; toggles a high-frequency EQ boost on/off.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:142
msgid "Toggle treble boost"
msgstr "បើក/បិទ ការបង្កើនស្តើងខ្ពស់ (treble boost)"

#. Translators: Short label used in the 'X enabled/disabled' announcement when toggling the treble-boost EQ band.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:148
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:778
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:182
msgid "EQ: Treble Boost"
msgstr "EQ: Treble Boost"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; toggles a mid-range EQ boost tuned for vocal clarity on/off.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:152
msgid "Toggle vocal boost"
msgstr "បើក/បិទ ការបង្កើនសំឡេងមនុស្ស (vocal boost)"

#. Translators: Short label used in the 'X enabled/disabled' announcement when toggling the vocal-boost EQ band.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:158
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:778
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:183
msgid "EQ: Vocal Boost"
msgstr "EQ: Vocal Boost"

#. Translators: Announcement after toggling an EQ band; %(effect)s is one of the 'EQ: ... Boost' labels above, %(state)s is 'enabled'/'disabled' below.
#. Translators: Announcement after toggling; %(effect)s is the plain-text feature name below (with its '&' access-key marker stripped), %(state)s is 'enabled'/'disabled'.
#. Translators: Same toggle-announcement pattern as script_toggleAnnounceTrackChanges above.
#. Translators: Effect on/off status spoken when hovering over an item in the Effects checklist; %(effect)s is the effect name, %(state)s the enabled/disabled word below.
#. Translators: Same effect on/off announcement as _on_fx_focus above, spoken here after actually toggling the effect (checklist click).
#. Translators: Same effect on/off announcement, spoken here after toggling via the Ctrl+1..Ctrl+0 keyboard shortcuts.
#. Translators: Same "%(effect)s %(state)s" announcement pattern as radioDialog.py's _toggle_eq_band; spoken here when hovering an item in the Settings effects checklist. %(state)s is "enabled"/"disabled" below.
#. Translators: Same announcement as the hover handler above, spoken here after actually toggling an effect via the checklist checkbox.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:221
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:76
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:125
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:1795
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:1808
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:1833
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:702
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:714
#, python-format
msgid "%(effect)s %(state)s"
msgstr "%(effect)s %(state)s"

#. Translators: Second half of the 'X enabled/disabled' announcement in _toggle_eq_band; describes the EQ band's new on/off state.
#. Translators: Second half of the toggle announcement above; describes the feature's new on/off state.
#. Translators: Second half of the toggle announcement; describes the feature's new on/off state.
#. Translators: The two possible %(state)s values above, and in the two other identical announcements in _on_fx_changed/_toggle_fx_by_index below.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:224
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:80
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:129
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:1798
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:1810
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:1835
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:704
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:716
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:413
msgid "enabled"
msgstr "បានបើកដំណើរការ"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:224
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:80
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:129
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:1798
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:1810
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:1835
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:704
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:716
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:413
msgid "disabled"
msgstr "បានបិទដំណើរការ"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; cycles the sound effect played when switching stations (crossfade/instant cut/tuning effect).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:229
msgid "Toggle station switch transition (crossfade)"
msgstr "បើក/បិទ បែបផែនការប្តូរស្ថានីយ (crossfade)"

#. Translators: One of the station-transition modes cycled by the crossfade command: plays no transition sound, cuts instantly.
#. Translators: Choices for the crossfade setting, same wording and order as the in-app toggleStationTransition command's cycle (audioFxMixin.py) - continues for the next three lines.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:237
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:226
msgid "Instant cut (no crossfade)"
msgstr "កាត់ភ្លាមៗ (គ្មាន crossfade)"

#. Translators: One of the station-transition modes: a brief 1-second audio crossfade between the old and new station.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:239
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:227
msgid "Short crossfade (1 second)"
msgstr "Crossfade ខ្លី (១ វិនាទី)"

#. Translators: One of the station-transition modes: a longer 2-second audio crossfade between the old and new station.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:241
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:228
msgid "Normal crossfade (2 seconds)"
msgstr "Crossfade ធម្មតា (២ វិនាទី)"

#. Translators: One of the station-transition modes: plays a radio-tuning sound effect instead of a crossfade.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioFxMixin.py:243
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:229
msgid "Station tuning sound effect"
msgstr "បែបផែនការសំឡេងលៃតម្រូវស្ថានីយ"

#. Translators: Fallback catalog-search result title when GETEM returns no usable link text.
#. Translators: Fallback GetemBook.title when no title was supplied at construction.
#. Translators: Fallback GetemBook.title when the detail page has no parseable title element.
#. Translators: Fallback book title when archive.org returns no title metadata for a search result.
#. Translators: Fallback GutenbergAudiobook.title when no title was supplied at construction.
#. Translators: Fallback book title when archive.org returns no title metadata for a search result.
#. Translators: Fallback LibrivoxBook.title when no title was supplied at construction.
#. Translators: Fallback station name (used only for the confirmation message below) if the station has no name field at all.
#. Translators: Fallback station name when a station dict has none.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:430
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:460
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:1133
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:190
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:286
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:160
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:257
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:3692
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\utils.py:338
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "មិនស្គាល់"

#. Translators: Fixed source label for GETEM audiobooks, shown in the station-details dialog and the Audio Books tab (same role as gutenberg_audiobooks.py's 'audiobook_source').
#. Translators: Source-name label for a book from GETEM (Boğaziçi University audio e-library) - the fallback when the book is neither LibriVox nor Project Gutenberg.
#. Reuses the exact same bare "GETEM"/"LibriVox"/"Project Gutenberg"
#. strings RadioDialog._audiobook_source_label_for() already shows
#. next to each book in the Audio Books tab, rather than
#. introducing new, differently-worded translations for the same
#. three names.
#. Translators: Names in the audio-book-sources checklist below; see the comment above for why these reuse RadioDialog's existing source-label strings rather than new translations.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:568
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:7170
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:523
msgid "GETEM"
msgstr "GETEM"

#. Translators: Error returned by GetemSession.login() when freeAudio has no saved GETEM credentials at all.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:652
msgid "Please enter your GETEM username and password in freeAudio's settings."
msgstr "សូមបញ្ចូលឈ្មោះអ្នកប្រើ និងពាក្យសម្ងាត់ GETEM របស់អ្នកនៅក្នុងការកំណត់ freeAudio។"

#. Translators: Error returned by GetemSession.login() when the GETEM server rejects the saved username/password.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:686
msgid "GETEM login failed. Please check your username and password."
msgstr "ការចូល GETEM បានបរាជ័យ។ សូមពិនិត្យឈ្មោះអ្នកប្រើ និងពាក្យសម្ងាត់របស់អ្នក។"

#. Translators: Error returned before attempting login when the settings dialog's GETEM username/password fields are empty.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:720
msgid ""
"Please enter your GETEM username and password in freeAudio's settings first."
msgstr "សូមបញ្ចូលឈ្មោះអ្នកប្រើ និងពាក្យសម្ងាត់ GETEM របស់អ្នកនៅក្នុងការកំណត់ freeAudio ជាមុនសិន។"

#. Translators: Error returned by search_getem() when the user submits an empty search box.
#. Translators: Error returned by search_gutenberg_audiobooks() when the user submits an empty search box.
#. Translators: Error returned by search_librivox() when the user submits an empty search box.
#. Translators: Spoken when the search button/enter is used with an empty search box.
#. Translators: Spoken when the jukebox device-search is used with an empty search box.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:756
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:231
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:197
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:7411
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:8522
msgid "Please enter a search term."
msgstr "សូមបញ្ចូលពាក្យស្វែងរក។"

#. Translators: Error returned by search_getem() when the GETEM catalog page itself could not be fetched (network failure).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:763
msgid "Could not reach GETEM's catalog. Please check your internet connection."
msgstr "មិនអាចចូលទៅកាន់កាតាឡុក GETEM បានទេ។ សូមពិនិត្យការតភ្ជាប់អ៊ីនធឺណិតរបស់អ្នក។"

#. Translators: Fallback chapter title for a multi-part work whose parts have no individual names; '{0}' is the book title, '{1}' the 1-based part number.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:886
msgid "{0} - Part {1}"
msgstr "{0} - ផ្នែក {1}"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:924
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:1151
msgid ""
"No playable audio file was found on this work's GETEM page. It may require "
"manual download from the site."
msgstr ""
"រកមិនឃើញឯកសារសំឡេងដែលអាចចាក់បាននៅលើទំព័រ GETEM នៃស្នាដៃនេះទេ។ "
"វាអាចត្រូវការទាញយកដោយដៃពីគេហទំព័រ។"

#. Translators: Error returned by get_book_by_url() when the pasted URL doesn't look like a GETEM work page link.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:1115
msgid "This doesn't look like a GETEM work link."
msgstr "នេះមើលទៅមិនដូចជាតំណភ្ជាប់ស្នាដៃ GETEM ទេ។"

#. Translators: Raised when a chapter download completes but produced a zero-byte file, usually because the GETEM session was not actually logged in.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:1249
msgid "The downloaded file was empty. Please check your GETEM login."
msgstr "ឯកសារដែលបានទាញយកគឺទទេ។ សូមពិនិត្យការចូល GETEM របស់អ្នក។"

#. Translators: Raised when the URL fetched for a chapter returns a response that is not audio at all (e.g. an HTML error/login page).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:1267
#, python-format
msgid "GETEM did not return audio for this part: %s"
msgstr "GETEM មិនបានត្រឡប់សំឡេងសម្រាប់ផ្នែកនេះទេ៖ %s"

#. Translators: Same failure as the message above (no valid audio came back for this part), used when there is no response snippet available to show.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:1269
msgid "GETEM did not return a playable audio file for this part."
msgstr "GETEM មិនបានត្រឡប់ឯកសារសំឡេងដែលអាចចាក់បានសម្រាប់ផ្នែកនេះទេ។"

#. Translators: Fallback download folder name used when saving a book, if the book's title is empty or has no usable characters.
#. Translators: Fallback folder name used when saving a downloaded book, if the book's title is empty or has no usable characters.
#. Translators: Fallback chapter title when an RSS <item> in the LibriVox feed has no <title> element.
#. Translators: Fallback folder name used when saving a downloaded book, if the book's title is empty or has no usable characters.
#. Translators: Fallback episode title when an RSS <item> has no <title> element.
#. Translators: Fallback episode title when an Atom <entry> has no <atom:title> element.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\getem.py:1542
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:621
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:560
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:663
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\podcast.py:486
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\podcast.py:537
msgid "Untitled"
msgstr "គ្មានចំណងជើង"

#. Shown as this book's narrator (see GutenbergAudiobook.__init__) instead
#. of leaving the field blank the way LibriVox does (which credits a
#. different human reader per chapter) - every book in this collection
#. shares the same kind of narration, so one fixed, honest label is more
#. useful here than an empty field.
#. Translators: Fixed narrator label shown for every book in this AI-narrated collection, in place of a per-book human reader's name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:137
msgid "AI-generated narration (Microsoft neural text-to-speech)"
msgstr "ការនិទានដែលបង្កើតដោយ AI (Microsoft neural text-to-speech)"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:215
#, python-format
msgid "AI narration, %s"
msgstr "ការនិទានដោយ AI, %s"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:217
msgid "AI narration"
msgstr "ការនិទានដោយ AI"

#. Translators: %s = the specific AI voice name, e.g. "SteffanNeural"
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:300
#, python-format
msgid "AI-generated narration (Microsoft neural text-to-speech, %s voice)"
msgstr "ការនិទានដែលបង្កើតដោយ AI (Microsoft neural text-to-speech, សំឡេង %s)"

#. Translators: shown as this book's source in the station-details
#. dialog and the Audio Books tab - kept distinct from bare
#. "LibriVox"/"GETEM" (see RadioDialog._audiobook_source_label_for())
#. since this collection is machine-narrated rather than a
#. volunteer-read or library-hosted human-narrated catalog.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:354
msgid "Project Gutenberg (AI narration)"
msgstr "គម្រោង Gutenberg (ការនិទានដោយ AI)"

#. Translators: Error returned by resolve_media() when the book has no linked archive.org item id, so no audio files can be looked up.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:401
msgid "This book has no archive.org item to read audio files from."
msgstr "សៀវភៅនេះគ្មានធាតុ archive.org សម្រាប់អានឯកសារសំឡេងទេ។"

#. Translators: Error returned by get_book_by_url() when the pasted URL doesn't match archive.org's book-details link pattern.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:424
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:418
msgid "This doesn't look like an archive.org book link."
msgstr "នេះមើលទៅមិនដូចជាតំណភ្ជាប់សៀវភៅ archive.org ទេ។"

#. Translators: Error returned when the archive.org identifier from a pasted link does not resolve to any item at all.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:443
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:437
msgid "Could not find a book at this address on archive.org."
msgstr "មិនអាចរកឃើញសៀវភៅនៅអាសយដ្ឋាននេះនៅលើ archive.org ទេ។"

#. Translators: Error returned when the resolved archive.org item exists but isn't tagged as part of this specific audiobook collection.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:451
msgid ""
"This archive.org item isn't part of the Project Gutenberg Open Audiobook "
"Collection."
msgstr ""
"ធាតុ archive.org នេះមិនមែនជាផ្នែកនៃបណ្ណាល័យសៀវភៅជាសំឡេងបើកចំហរបស់គម្រោង Gutenberg ទេ។"

#. Translators: Error returned by the chapter-listing step when archive.org has no playable audio file for the resolved book.
#. Translators: Error returned by the archive.org metadata path when no playable audio file was found for the resolved book.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:514
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:498
msgid "No playable audio file was found for this book on archive.org."
msgstr "រកមិនឃើញឯកសារសំឡេងដែលអាចចាក់បានសម្រាប់សៀវភៅនេះនៅលើ archive.org ទេ។"

#. Translators: Raised internally when a chapter/book download completes but produced a zero-byte file; caught and shown to the user as a download failure.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\gutenberg_audiobooks.py:579
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:621
msgid "The downloaded file was empty."
msgstr "ឯកសារដែលបានទាញយកគឺទទេ។"

#. Translators: %(name)s = folder name, %(count)d = number of audio files found in it
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\jukebox.py:1039
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s (folder, %(count)d tracks)"
msgstr "%(name)s (ថត, បទ %(count)d)"

#. Translators: Error returned by JukeboxManager.add_file() when the given path does not exist; %s is the file path.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\jukebox.py:1211
#, python-format
msgid "File not found: %s"
msgstr "រកមិនឃើញឯកសារ: %s"

#. Translators: Error returned by JukeboxManager.add_file() when the file's extension isn't one of the supported audio formats; %s is the file path.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\jukebox.py:1214
#, python-format
msgid "Not a recognized audio file: %s"
msgstr "មិនមែនជាឯកសារសំឡេងដែលស្គាល់: %s"

#. Translators: Error returned by JukeboxManager.add_file()/add_folder() when that exact path is already saved in the jukebox library.
#. Translators: See the add_file() comment above: same message, returned by add_folder() when the folder is already in the jukebox.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\jukebox.py:1217
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\jukebox.py:1231
msgid "Already in the jukebox."
msgstr "មាននៅក្នុង jukebox រួចហើយ។"

#. Translators: Error returned by JukeboxManager.add_folder() when the given folder path does not exist; %s is the folder path.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\jukebox.py:1228
#, python-format
msgid "Folder not found: %s"
msgstr "រកមិនឃើញថត: %s"

#. Translators: Error returned by JukeboxManager.add_folder() when the folder was scanned but contains no recognized audio files.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\jukebox.py:1236
msgid "No audio files found in that folder."
msgstr "រកមិនឃើញឯកសារសំឡេងនៅក្នុងថតនោះទេ។"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\jukebox.py:1347
msgid "Not a valid jukebox export file."
msgstr ""

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\jukebox.py:1397
msgid "Not a valid M3U playlist file."
msgstr ""

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\legacyMigration.py:179
msgid ""
"The previous version of this add-on, FreeRadio, is still installed alongside "
"freeAudio. Running both at the same time makes them compete for the same "
"shortcuts and audio device. Your settings and data have been copied to "
"freeAudio. Please uninstall FreeRadio (NVDA menu, Tools, Add-on Store or "
"Manage add-ons) and restart NVDA."
msgstr ""
"កំណែមុននៃកម្មវិធីបន្ថែមនេះ គឺ FreeRadio នៅតែត្រូវបានដំឡើងជាមួយ freeAudio។ "
"ការដំណើរការទាំងពីរក្នុងពេលតែមួយធ្វើឱ្យពួកវាប្រកួតប្រជែងគ្នាសម្រាប់ផ្លូវកាត់ និងឧបករណ៍សំឡេងដូចគ្នា។ "
"ការកំណត់ និងទិន្នន័យរបស់អ្នកត្រូវបានចម្លងទៅ freeAudio។ សូមលុបកម្មវិធីបន្ថែម FreeRadio (ម៉ឺនុយ "
"NVDA ឧបករណ៍ ហាងកម្មវិធីបន្ថែម ឬគ្រប់គ្រងកម្មវិធីបន្ថែម) ហើយចាប់ផ្តើម NVDA ឡើងវិញ។"

#. Translators: Fixed source label for LibriVox audiobooks, shown in the station-details dialog and the Audio Books tab (same role as getem.py's/gutenberg_audiobooks.py's 'audiobook_source').
#. Translators: Source-name label for a book from the LibriVox catalog, shown alongside the audio-book details.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:339
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:7165
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:523
msgid "LibriVox"
msgstr "LibriVox"

#. Translators: Error returned when a LibriVox book has no linked RSS feed (used as a fallback path when archive.org's own file listing didn't work) to read chapters from.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:536
msgid "This book has no LibriVox RSS feed to read chapters from."
msgstr "សៀវភៅនេះមិនមាន RSS feed LibriVox ដើម្បីអានជំពូកពីវាទេ។"

#. Translators: Error returned when a LibriVox RSS feed contains XML entity declarations, which are rejected as a security measure against entity-expansion attacks.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:545
msgid "The feed contains XML entity declarations and was rejected."
msgstr "ហ្វីតមានការប្រកាស XML entity ហើយត្រូវបានបដិសេធ។"

#. Translators: Error returned when the book's LibriVox RSS feed could not be fetched or parsed.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:555
msgid "Could not read this book's chapter list."
msgstr "មិនអាចអានបញ្ជីជំពូករបស់សៀវភៅនេះបានទេ។"

#. Translators: Error returned when the LibriVox RSS feed was read successfully but contains no playable audio items.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\librivox.py:569
msgid "No playable audio file was found in this book's LibriVox feed."
msgstr "រកមិនឃើញឯកសារសំឡេងដែលអាចចាក់បាននៅក្នុង feed LibriVox របស់សៀវភៅនេះទេ។"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; mutes/unmutes all of freeAudio's spoken notifications (station changes, playback state, recording, volume level) at once.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:34
msgid ""
"Toggle mute notifications (station changes, playback, recording, volume "
"level)"
msgstr ""
"បិទ/បើកការជូនដំណឹងអំពីការបិទសំឡេង (station changes, playback, recording, volume "
"level)"

#. Notifications are now muted — speak this final confirmation before silencing.
#. Translators: Spoken once, right before notifications go silent, to confirm the toggle happened (further notifications are suppressed after this).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:44
msgid "Notifications muted"
msgstr "បានបិទសំឡេងការជូនដំណឹង"

#. Translators: Spoken when notifications are turned back on.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:47
msgid "Notifications unmuted"
msgstr "បាន​បើក​សំឡេង​ការ​ជូន​ដំណឹង"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; toggles whether freeAudio announces a station's track/song changes from ICY stream metadata.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:53
msgid "Enable or disable auto-announce track changes (ICY metadata)"
msgstr "បើក ឬបិទ ការប្រកាសដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិនៅពេលផ្លាស់ប្តូរចំណិត (ទិន្នន័យ ICY)"

#. Translators: Feature name reused as both the settings-panel checkbox label (with '&' marking its access key) and, with the '&' stripped, as %(effect)s in the toggle announcement above.
#. Translators: Checkbox label for the track-change announcement setting (same feature as the toggleAnnounceTrackChanges command).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:78
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:251
msgid "&Auto-announce track changes (ICY metadata)"
msgstr "ប្រកាសការផ្លាស់ប្តូរបទចម្រៀង ឬតន្ត្រីដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ (ICY metadata) &A"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; switches which voice (NVDA's current synth, or a separate SAPI5 voice) speaks track-change announcements.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:85
msgid "Switch track change announcement voice"
msgstr "ប្តូរសំឡេងប្រកាសការផ្លាស់ប្តូរចំណិត"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; toggles whether liked/favourited songs are also appended to a plain text file on disk.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:107
msgid "Turn on or off saving liked songs to a text file"
msgstr "បើក ឬបិទ ការរក្សាទុកបទចម្រៀងដែលចូលចិត្តទៅក្នុងឯកសារអត្ថបទ"

#. Translators: Feature name for the save-liked-songs toggle, used the same way as the track-change one above (checkbox label with '&' access key, and %(effect)s with it stripped).
#. Translators: Checkbox label for the save-liked-songs setting (same feature as the toggleSaveLikedSongs command).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\miscTogglesMixin.py:127
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\settingsPanel.py:343
msgid "&Save liked songs to a text file"
msgstr "រក្សាទុកបទចម្រៀងដែលចូលចិត្តទៅក្នុងឯកសារអត្ថបទ &S"

#. Translators: Raised internally when the captured audio snippet has no detectable frequency content to fingerprint (e.g. silence or dead air); surfaces as a recognition failure.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\musicRecognizer.py:616
msgid "No frequency peaks found — audio may be silence"
msgstr "រកមិនឃើញប្រេកង់ខ្ពស់បំផុតទេ - សំឡេងប្រហែលជាស្ងាត់"

#. Translators: Raised when Shazam's API responds but has no match for the submitted audio fingerprint.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\musicRecognizer.py:666
msgid "Song not recognized"
msgstr "ចម្រៀងមិនស្គាល់"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\musicRecognizer.py:732
msgid ""
"ffmpeg.exe not found. Download ffmpeg from https://ffmpeg.org/download.html "
"and place ffmpeg.exe in the freeAudio addon folder, or set the path in "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"រកមិនឃើញ ffmpeg.exe ទេ។ ទាញយក ffmpeg ពី https://ffmpeg.org/download.html "
"ហើយដាក់ ffmpeg.exe នៅក្នុងឯកសារកម្មវិធីជំនួយរបស់ freeAudio ឬកំណត់ path ក្នុងការកំណត់។"

#. Translators: Title of the Obligato mode setup dialog.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:55
msgid "Obligato Mode"
msgstr "របៀប Obligato"

#. Translators: Static label above the favourite-station picker in the Obligato setup dialog.
#. Translators: Accessible name for the favourite-station picker list (same text as the static label above it).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:65
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:73
msgid "Background station:"
msgstr "ស្ថានីយ៍ផ្ទៃខាងក្រោយ៖"

#. Translators: Static label above the output-device choice in the Obligato setup dialog.
#. Translators: Accessible name for the output-device choice control.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:89
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:102
msgid "Audio output:"
msgstr "ទិន្នផលសំឡេង៖"

#. Translators: The two fixed entries in the Obligato output-device choice: play through the same device as the main player, or through a separately chosen device.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:95
msgid "Same as main output"
msgstr "ដូចគ្នានឹងទិន្នផលសំខាន់"

#. Translators: Static label above the background-volume choice in the Obligato setup dialog.
#. Translators: Accessible name for the background-volume choice control.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:129
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:144
msgid "Background volume:"
msgstr "កម្រិតសំឡេងផ្ទៃខាងក្រោយ៖"

#. Translators: Volume option meaning the background station plays at the
#. same level as the main player.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:137
msgid "100% (same as main volume)"
msgstr "100% (ដូចគ្នានឹងកម្រិតសំឡេងសំខាន់)"

#. Translators: Volume option expressed as a percentage of the main
#. player's current volume, e.g. "50% of main volume". %d is the percentage.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:141
#, python-format
msgid "%d%% of main volume"
msgstr "%d%% នៃកម្រិតសំឡេងសំខាន់"

#. Translators: 'Start' button label in the Obligato setup dialog, confirming the chosen station/device/volume and beginning background playback.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:157
msgid "&Start"
msgstr "ចាប់ផ្តើម &S"

#. Translators: Spoken if the user presses Start without selecting a background station.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:176
msgid "Please select a station for the background music."
msgstr "សូមជ្រើសរើសស្ថានីយ៍មួយសម្រាប់តន្ត្រីផ្ទៃខាងក្រោយ។"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command (default Ctrl+Shift+Windows+M); starts or stops Obligato background-music mode.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:205
msgid "Toggle Obligato background music mode"
msgstr "បើក/បិទ របៀបតន្ត្រីផ្ទៃខាងក្រោយ Obligato"

#. Translators: Spoken when the toggle command is pressed but the favourites list is empty, since Obligato can only play a saved favourite station.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:221
msgid ""
"No favourite stations. Add a station to favourites first to use Obligato "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"គ្មានស្ថានីយ៍ក្នុងបញ្ជីចំណូលចិត្តទេ។ សូមបន្ថែមស្ថានីយ៍មួយទៅក្នុងបញ្ជីចំណូលចិត្តជាមុនសិន ដើម្បីប្រើរបៀប "
"Obligato។"

#. Translators: Spoken when the chosen background station has no resolvable stream URL to play.
#. Translators: Spoken when trying to play a station that has no resolvable stream URL at all.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:284
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:768
msgid "No stream URL available for this station"
msgstr "គ្មាន stream URL សម្រាប់ស្ថានីយ៍វិទ្យុនេះទេ"

#. Translators: Spoken when starting Obligato mode fails because there is no internet connection to reach the chosen station.
#. Translators: Spoken when trying to play a station but the internet-connectivity pre-check fails.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:299
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:779
msgid "No internet connection. Please check your connection and try again."
msgstr "គ្មានការតភ្ជាប់អ៊ីនធឺណិតទេ។ សូមពិនិត្យមើលការតភ្ជាប់របស់អ្នក ហើយព្យាយាមម្តងទៀត។"

#. Translators: Generic fallback spoken when starting Obligato mode fails for an unspecified reason.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:308
msgid "Could not start Obligato mode."
msgstr "មិនអាចចាប់ផ្តើមរបៀប Obligato បានទេ។"

#. Translators: Spoken once the background station actually starts playing in Obligato mode; %s is the station name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:346
#, python-format
msgid "Obligato mode started: %s"
msgstr "របៀប Obligato បានចាប់ផ្តើម៖ %s"

#. Translators: Spoken if the background station's connection fails outright while in Obligato mode; %(name)s is the station name, %(reason)s a short failure description.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:400
#, python-format
msgid "Could not play %(name)s in Obligato mode: %(reason)s"
msgstr "មិនអាចចាក់ %(name)s ក្នុងរបៀប Obligato បានទេ៖ %(reason)s"

#. Translators: Spoken when Obligato mode is turned off and the background station stops.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\obligatoMixin.py:428
msgid "Obligato mode stopped"
msgstr "របៀប Obligato បានបញ្ឈប់"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; pauses playback (single press), with double/triple-press doing other actions - see the docstring above.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:83
msgid "Pause or resume freeAudio playback"
msgstr "ផ្អាក ឬបន្តការចាក់សំឡេងរបស់ freeAudio"

#. Translators: Spoken when the pause/resume command pauses playback.
#. Translators: Same "Paused" wording as the F7 shortcut and the NVDA pause command; spoken here when the Play/Pause button pauses playback.
#. Translators: Spoken when F7 pauses playback from inside the dialog.
#. Translators: Same "Paused" wording as elsewhere; spoken here when Space pauses playback from the All Stations list.
#. Translators: Same "Paused" wording as elsewhere; spoken here when Space pauses playback from the Favourites list.
#. Translators: Same "Paused" wording as elsewhere; spoken here when Space pauses playback from the podcast episode list.
#. Translators: Same "Paused" wording as elsewhere; spoken here when Space pauses playback from the audio-book library list.
#. Translators: Same "Paused" wording as elsewhere; spoken here when Space pauses playback from the jukebox library list.
#. Translators: Same "Paused" wording as elsewhere; spoken here when Space pauses playback from the jukebox tracks list.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:161
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:3446
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:4113
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:4687
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:4742
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:6531
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:7725
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:8901
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:8991
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "បានផ្អាក"

#. Translators: Spoken when the pause/resume command resumes playback.
#. Translators: Spoken when F7 resumes playback from inside the dialog.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:165
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:4118
msgid "Playing"
msgstr "កំពុងចាក់"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; stops freeAudio playback outright (as opposed to pausing).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:183
msgid "Stop freeAudio playback"
msgstr "បញ្ឈប់ការចាក់សំឡេងរបស់ freeAudio"

#. Translators: Line in the stop-confirmation dialog listing an in-progress, immediately-started recording that will be cut off; %s is the station name.
#. Translators: Line listing an in-progress instant recording in the F8 stop-confirmation dialog; %s is the station name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:197
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:615
#, python-format
msgid "Instant recording: %s"
msgstr "ការថតភ្លាមៗ: %s"

#. Translators: Line in the stop-confirmation dialog listing an active scheduled recording that will be cut off; %s is the station name.
#. Translators: Appended to the What's Playing announcement for each active scheduled recording; %s is that recording's station name.
#. Translators: Same active-scheduled-recording announcement as the playing-state case, appended here when paused.
#. Translators: Same active-scheduled-recording announcement as script_whatsPlaying.
#. Translators: Same active-scheduled-recording announcement as script_whatsPlaying's paused case.
#. Translators: Line listing an active scheduled recording in the F8 stop-confirmation dialog; %s is the station name.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:200
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:193
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:232
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:500
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:530
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:618
#, python-format
msgid "Scheduled recording: %s"
msgstr "ការកំណត់ពេលថត: %s"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:204
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:622
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The following recordings are active and will be stopped:\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"Stop radio and end all recordings?"
msgstr ""
"ការថតទាំងអស់ខាងក្រោមនេះកំពុងតែដំណើរការ ហើយនឹងត្រូវបានបញ្ឈប់:\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"តើចង់បញ្ឈប់វិទ្យុ ហើយបញ្ចប់ដំណើរការថតទាំងអស់នេះមែនទេ?"

#. Translators: Title of the confirmation dialog shown when stopping playback would cut off active recordings.
#. Translators: Title of the F8 stop-confirmation dialog.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:212
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:630
msgid "Active Recordings"
msgstr "កំពុងដំណើរការថត"

#. Translators: Spoken after confirming the stop when active recordings were involved.
#. Translators: Spoken when the stop command is used and there were no active recordings to confirm about.
#. Translators: Spoken by F8 (stop) after confirming the stop and ending any active recordings.
#. Translators: Spoken by F8 (stop) when there were no active recordings to confirm about.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:226
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:238
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:644
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:658
msgid "freeAudio stopped"
msgstr "freeAudio បានបញ្ឈប់ហើយ"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; skips to the next station in the favourites list.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:242
msgid "Play next station"
msgstr "ចាក់ស្ថានីយ៍វិទ្យុបន្ទាប់"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; skips to the previous station in the favourites list.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:279
msgid "Play previous station"
msgstr "ចាក់ស្ថានីយ៍វិទ្យុមុន"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:723
msgid ""
"Could not resume the last audio book - it may have been removed from your "
"library."
msgstr "មិនអាចបន្តសៀវភៅជាសំឡេងចុងក្រោយបានទេ - វាអាចត្រូវបានដកចេញពីបណ្ណាល័យរបស់អ្នក។"

#. Translators: Fallback station name used in log/error contexts if the station dict has no name field.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:761
msgid "Unknown station"
msgstr "ស្ថានីយ៍វិទ្យុដែលមិនស្គាល់"

#. Translators: Spoken by the pitch-transpose commands when the current transpose value is back to 0 (no pitch shift applied).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:975
msgid "Normal pitch"
msgstr "កម្ពស់សំឡេងធម្មតា"

#. Translators: %.2f = signed semitone value, e.g. "+1.25 semitones"
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:977
#, python-format
msgid "%+.2f semitones"
msgstr "%+.2f សេមីតូន"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; raises the pitch of podcasts/audio books/jukebox tracks without changing playback speed.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:981
msgid "Raise pitch transpose (podcasts, audio books and jukebox tracks)"
msgstr "លើកកម្ពស់សំឡេង (សម្រាប់ផតខាស់ សៀវភៅជាសំឡេង និងបទក្នុង jukebox)"

#. Translators: Spoken when the pitch-transpose commands are used while playing a live radio station rather than a podcast/audiobook/jukebox track.
#. Translators: Same as the transposeUp case above: spoken when transpose is used on a live radio station.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:991
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:1010
msgid "Transpose only applies to podcasts, audio books and jukebox tracks"
msgstr "ការប្ដូរកម្ពស់សំឡេងអនុវត្តចំពោះតែផតខាស់ សៀវភៅជាសំឡេង និងបទក្នុង jukebox ប៉ុណ្ណោះ"

#. Translators: Spoken when pitch transpose can't be applied because the optional bass_fx library isn't installed.
#. Translators: Same as the transposeUp case above: spoken when bass_fx isn't installed.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:994
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:1013
msgid "Transpose requires the bass_fx audio component, which isn't available"
msgstr "ការប្ដូរកម្ពស់សំឡេងត្រូវការសមាសធាតុសំឡេង bass_fx ដែលមិនមាន"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; lowers the pitch of podcasts/audio books/jukebox tracks without changing playback speed.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:1000
msgid "Lower pitch transpose (podcasts, audio books and jukebox tracks)"
msgstr "បន្ថយកម្ពស់សំឡេង (សម្រាប់ផតខាស់ សៀវភៅជាសំឡេង និងបទក្នុង jukebox)"

#. Only caller now is _play_station()'s _apply_profile_and_play()
#. background thread (see its comment on why it calls this
#. directly rather than via wx.CallAfter) - ui.message needs to
#. stay marshalled onto the main thread from here since we're not
#. on it.
#. Translators: Spoken when actually starting playback of a station/track fails with an exception; %s is the error message.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\playbackCoreMixin.py:1027
#, python-format
msgid "Could not play station: %s"
msgstr "មិនអាចចាក់ស្ថានីយ៍វិទ្យុបានទេ: %s"

#. Translators: Prefix prepended to a podcast episode's list label when it has been fully listened to; shown in place of the elapsed/total duration suffix.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\podcast.py:187
msgid "[Listened]"
msgstr "[បានស្ដាប់]"

#. Translators: Error returned by PodcastManager.add_feed() when this exact feed URL is already in the subscription list.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\podcast.py:345
msgid "Already subscribed."
msgstr "បានជាវរួចហើយ។"

#. Translators: Error returned by PodcastManager.add_feed() when the feed was fetched and parsed but contains zero episodes.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\podcast.py:353
msgid "No episodes found in this feed."
msgstr "រកមិនឃើញភាគណាមួយនៅក្នុងហ្វីតនេះទេ។"

#. Translators: Error returned by PodcastManager.refresh_feed() when the given feed is not among the current subscriptions.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\podcast.py:387
msgid "Feed not found."
msgstr "រកមិនឃើញហ្វីតទេ។"

#. Translators: Not shown to the user: internal 'no change' result from an HTTP 304 (feed unchanged since last fetch) response, so refresh can skip re-parsing. Kept as a translatable string for consistency with the other returned messages, though callers treat it as a no-op rather than an error to display.
#. Translators: Same 304-not-modified no-op result as above, returned from the Atom parsing branch.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\podcast.py:422
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\podcast.py:458
msgid "No new episodes (304)."
msgstr "គ្មានភាគថ្មីទេ (304)។"

#. Translators: Error returned when a subscribed feed's response is larger than the 10 MB safety cap (a real feed never is).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\podcast.py:427
msgid "Feed is too large (>10 MB)."
msgstr "ហ្វីតធំពេកណាស់ (>10 MB)។"

#. Translators: Error returned when a subscribed feed contains XML entity declarations, which are rejected as a security measure against entity-expansion attacks.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\podcast.py:441
msgid "Feed contains XML entity declarations and was rejected."
msgstr "ហ្វីតមានការប្រកាស XML entity ហើយត្រូវបានបដិសេធ។"

#. Translators: Error returned when a subscribed feed's content can't be parsed as either RSS or Atom XML.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\podcast.py:450
msgid "Unrecognized feed format (not RSS or Atom)."
msgstr "ទម្រង់ហ្វីតមិនស្គាល់ (មិនមែន RSS ឬ Atom)។"

#. Translators: Label above the folder-choice controls for where a recording will be saved (shared by the Add Schedule panel and EditScheduleDialog).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:260
msgid "Save recording to:"
msgstr "រក្សាទុកការថតទៅ៖"

#. Translators: Radio button: save this recording to freeAudio's default recordings folder.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:265
msgid "&Default recordings folder"
msgstr "ថតលំនាំដើមសម្រាប់ការថត &D"

#. Translators: Radio button: save this recording to a specific folder chosen below.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:268
msgid "&Selected folder:"
msgstr "ថតដែលបានជ្រើសរើស &S:"

#. Translators: Accessible name for the custom-folder path field (same text as its radio-button label above).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:275
msgid "Selected folder:"
msgstr "ថតដែលបានជ្រើសរើស៖"

#. Translators: Button label; opens a folder-picker to choose where to save this recording.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:277
msgid "Bro&wse..."
