#. jukebox.JukeboxEntry.tracks(). ---
#. Translators: Label above the list of tracks contained in the selected jukebox entry (a folder's individual audio files).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:8413
msgid "Tracks:"
msgstr "បទ:"

#. Translators: Accessible name for the jukebox tracks list.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\radioDialog.py:8416
msgid "Tracks in the selected jukebox item"
msgstr "បទនៅក្នុងធាតុ jukebox ដែលបានជ្រើសរើស"

