#, python-format
msgid "%(elapsed)s elapsed, %(remaining)s remaining"
msgstr "កន្លងផុត %(elapsed)s នៅសល់ %(remaining)s"

#. Translators: Same position announcement as above, used when the total length isn't known so only elapsed time can be reported.
#. Translators: Same elapsed-only wording as _announce_seek_position()'s no-length case, appended here when paused with an unknown total length.
#. Translators: Same elapsed-only wording as script_whatsPlaying's paused case.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:99
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:220
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:523
#, python-format
msgid "%(elapsed)s elapsed"
msgstr "កន្លងផុត %(elapsed)s"

#. Translators: Spoken if seeking to the start of an audio-book part/jukebox track (the boundary clamp itself) fails.
#. No dedicated "Start of track" wording here - the elapsed/
#. remaining position _announce_seek_position() reports (0:00
#. elapsed) already makes that obvious on its own. Its
#. only-if-unavailable fallback reuses the same generic wording
#. the failure case above already uses.
#. Translators: Fallback spoken if _announce_seek_position() can't report a position after seeking to the start/end of an audio-book part or jukebox track.
#. Translators: Spoken if a plain (non-boundary) podcast/audiobook seek fails.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:184
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:192
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:214
msgid "Could not seek"
msgstr "មិនអាចរំកិលបាន"

#. Translators: Fallback spoken only if _announce_seek_position() can't report a position; %d is the number of seconds seeked.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:218
#, python-format
msgid "Forwarded %d seconds"
msgstr "បានរំកិលទៅមុខ %d វិនាទី"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:219
#, python-format
msgid "Rewound %d seconds"
msgstr "បានរំកិលថយក្រោយ %d វិនាទី"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command (Ctrl+Win+J); rewinds the live time-shift buffer, or seeks backward within a podcast/audiobook file if one is playing.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:311
msgid ""
"Time-shift: rewind 15 seconds (enters time-shift mode if not already active)"
msgstr ""
"ការផ្លាស់ប្ដូរពេលវេលា: រំកិលថយក្រោយ ១៥ វិនាទី (ចូលមុខងារផ្លាស់ប្ដូរពេលវេលា "
"ប្រសិនបើមិនទាន់ស្ថិតនៅក្នុងនោះ)"

#. Translators: Spoken when Ctrl+Win+J (rewind) is pressed while the time-shift feature itself is turned off in settings.
#. Translators: Same message as the rewind command, spoken here when Ctrl+Win+K (forward) is pressed with time-shift turned off.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:325
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:336
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:365
msgid "Time-shift buffer is disabled. Enable it in freeAudio settings."
msgstr "ការផ្លាស់ប្ដូរពេលវេលាត្រូវបានបិទ។ បើកវានៅក្នុងការកំណត់ freeAudio។"

#. Translators: One of the reasons a rewind/forward can fail, mapped from rewind_timeshift()'s return reason to a spoken message (continues for the next six lines: feature disabled, wrong backend, HLS unsupported, not enough buffer yet, buffer file not ready, engine error).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:335
msgid ""
"Time-shift requires the BASS audio backend, which is currently disabled."
msgstr "ការផ្លាស់ប្ដូរពេលវេលាទាមទារ BASS backend ដែលបច្ចុប្បន្នត្រូវបានបិទ។"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:337
msgid "Time-shift is not available for the current playback backend."
msgstr "ការផ្លាស់ប្ដូរពេលវេលាមិនអាចប្រើបានសម្រាប់ backend ចាក់បច្ចុប្បន្នទេ។"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:338
msgid ""
"Time-shift is not supported for this station's stream (no seekable audio "
"could be extracted)."
msgstr ""
"ការផ្លាស់ប្ដូរពេលវេលាមិនត្រូវបានគាំទ្រសម្រាប់ស្ទ្រីមរបស់ស្ថានីយ៍នេះទេ "
"(មិនអាចទាញយកសំឡេងដែលអាចរំកិលបានទេ)។"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:339
msgid ""
"Not enough buffered audio to rewind yet. Wait a few seconds after the "
"station starts playing and try again."
msgstr ""
"មិនមានសំឡេងក្នុង buffer គ្រប់គ្រាន់ ដើម្បីដកថយទេ។ រង់ចាំពីរបីវិនាទីបន្ទាប់ពីស្ថានីយ៍ចាប់ផ្ដើមចាក់ "
"ហើយព្យាយាមម្ដងទៀត។"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:340
msgid "Time-shift buffer file is not ready yet."
msgstr "ឯកសារ buffer ការផ្លាស់ប្ដូរពេលវេលានៅមិនទាន់រួចរាល់ទេ។"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:341
msgid "Could not switch to time-shifted playback."
msgstr "មិនអាចប្ដូរទៅការចាក់ ជាមួយការផ្លាស់ប្ដូរពេលវេលាបានទេ។"

#. Translators: Generic fallback spoken if the rewind fails for a reason not covered by the specific messages above.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:344
msgid "Could not rewind"
msgstr "មិនអាចដកថយបានទេ"

#. Translators: Spoken after a successful rewind, reporting how far behind live the buffer now is; %.0f is the number of seconds.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:347
#, python-format
msgid "Rewound to %.0f seconds behind live"
msgstr "ដកថយទៅ %.0f វិនាទីមុនការផ្សាយផ្ទាល់"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command (Ctrl+Win+K); fast-forwards the live time-shift buffer (snapping to live once caught up), or seeks forward within a podcast/audiobook file if one is playing.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:351
msgid ""
"Time-shift: fast-forward 15 seconds, or return to live if already caught up"
msgstr "ការផ្លាស់ប្ដូរពេលវេលា: រំកិលទៅមុខ ១៥ វិនាទី ឬត្រឡប់ទៅការផ្សាយផ្ទាល់ ប្រសិនបើបានដល់ហើយ"

#. Translators: Spoken when fast-forward is pressed but playback is already at the live edge (not time-shifted).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:369
msgid "Already listening live"
msgstr "កំពុងស្ដាប់ការផ្សាយផ្ទាល់ហើយ"

#. Translators: Generic fallback spoken if the fast-forward operation fails.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:375
msgid "Could not fast-forward"
msgstr "មិនអាចរំកិលទៅមុខបានទេ"

#. Translators: Spoken when a fast-forward catches all the way up to the live edge.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:379
msgid "Back to live"
msgstr "ត្រឡប់ទៅការផ្សាយផ្ទាល់"

#. Translators: Spoken after a fast-forward that has not yet caught up to live; %.0f is how many seconds behind live remain.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:383
#, python-format
msgid "Fast-forwarded, still %.0f seconds behind live"
msgstr "បានរំកិលទៅមុខ នៅតែ %.0f វិនាទីមុនការផ្សាយផ្ទាល់"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command (Ctrl+Win+T); toggles the time-shift buffer feature on/off.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:388
msgid "Enable or disable the time-shift (rewind) buffer"
msgstr "បើក ឬបិទ buffer ការផ្លាស់ប្ដូរពេលវេលា (ការរំកិលថយក្រោយ)"

#. Translators: Spoken after toggling the time-shift buffer; the 'enabled'/'disabled' word is the same one used throughout freeAudio's other toggle announcements.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\timeshiftMixin.py:413
#, python-format
msgid "Time-shift buffer %s"
msgstr "Buffer ការផ្លាស់ប្ដូរពេលវេលា %s"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:108
#, python-format
msgid "Recognition failed: %s"
msgstr "ការទទួលស្គាល់បានបរាជ័យ: %s"

#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command (Ctrl+Win+I); its behaviour escalates with repeated presses as the description itself explains.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:120
msgid ""
"Announce currently playing station. Press twice for full details, three "
"times to copy track info, four times to force music recognition."
msgstr ""
"ប្រាប់ព័ត៌មានរបស់ស្ថានីយ៍វិទ្យុដែលកំពុងចាក់ឥឡូវនេះ។ ចុចពីរដងសម្រាប់ព័ត៌មានលម្អិតទាំងស្រុង "
"បីដងដើម្បីចម្លងព័ត៌មានបទចម្រៀង តន្ត្រី បួនដងដើម្បីបង្ខំការស្គាល់តន្ត្រី។"

#. Translators: First line of the What's Playing announcement when nothing is playing but one or more scheduled recordings are still running silently in the background; station names are appended after it, joined with two spaces.
#. Translators: Same as the Ctrl+Win+I version, spoken here by the F2 dialog equivalent.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:133
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:434
msgid "Radio inactive. Active scheduled recordings:"
msgstr "វិទ្យុមិនដំណើរការទេ។ ការកំណត់ពេលថតកំពុងដំណើរការ:"

#. Translators: Spoken by What's Playing when nothing is playing and no scheduled recording is active either.
#. Translators: Same "not active" message as What's Playing, spoken here when this standalone show-details gesture is used with nothing playing.
#. Translators: Same "not active" message as elsewhere, spoken here when this standalone copy/recognize gesture is used with nothing playing.
#. Translators: Same "not active" message as elsewhere, spoken here when this standalone force-recognition gesture is used with nothing playing.
#. Translators: Same "not active" message as elsewhere, spoken here by the F2 dialog equivalent of What's Playing.
#. Translators: Same "not active" message as elsewhere, spoken here when F8 (stop) is pressed with nothing playing and no recordings active.
#. Translators: Same "not active" message as elsewhere, spoken here by this hotkey-triggered station announcement.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:139
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:330
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:350
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:399
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:440
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:651
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:667
msgid "freeAudio is not active"
msgstr "freeAudio មិនដំណើរការទេ"

#. Translators: Announcement spoken by Ctrl+Win+I (What's Playing) when the station provides an ICY track title; %(station)s is the station name, %(track)s the current track.
#. Translators: Same What's Playing announcement as script_whatsPlaying, spoken here by the F2 in-dialog variant (_whats_playing_from_dialog); %(station)s/%(track)s as above.
#. Translators: Same Playing announcement as script_whatsPlaying, spoken here by this hotkey-triggered variant.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:167
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:480
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:683
#, python-format
msgid "Playing: %(station)s — %(track)s"
msgstr "កំពុងចាក់: %(station)s — %(track)s"

#. Translators: Same What's Playing announcement, used when no ICY track title is available - just the station name.
#. Translators: Same fallback as script_whatsPlaying, used when no ICY track title is available.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:172
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:485
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:688
#, python-format
msgid "Playing: %s"
msgstr "កំពុងចាក់: %s"

#. Translators: Appended to the What's Playing announcement when an instant recording is currently active; %s is the station being recorded.
#. Translators: Same active-recording announcement as the playing-state case, appended here when paused.
#. Translators: Same active-recording announcement as script_whatsPlaying.
#. Translators: Same active-recording announcement as script_whatsPlaying's paused case.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:187
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:226
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:497
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:527
#, python-format
msgid "Recording: %s"
msgstr "កំពុងថត: %s"

#. Translators: What's Playing announcement when playback is paused rather than actively playing; %s is the station/track name.
#. Translators: Same Paused announcement as script_whatsPlaying, spoken here by the F2 dialog equivalent.
#. Translators: Same Paused announcement as elsewhere, spoken here by this hotkey-triggered variant.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:200
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:505
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:702
#, python-format
msgid "Paused: %s"
msgstr "បានផ្អាក: %s"

#. Translators: Spoken by the triple-press (copy/recognize) action when there is no ICY metadata and no stream URL either, so nothing at all can be identified.
#. Called from the main thread (no wx.CallAfter needed).
#. Translators: Same as the triple-press case, spoken by the fourth press (force recognition) when there's no stream URL to even attempt recognition on.
#. Translators: Same as the What's Playing triple-press case, spoken here when this standalone gesture finds no ICY metadata and no stream URL either.
#. Translators: Same as elsewhere, spoken when this standalone gesture has no stream URL to attempt recognition on.
#. Translators: Same as the Ctrl+Win+I triple-press case, spoken here by the F2 dialog equivalent (3rd press).
#. Translators: Same as the Ctrl+Win+I fourth-press case, spoken here by the F2 dialog equivalent (4th press).
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:287
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:312
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:378
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:407
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:577
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:597
msgid "No track info available"
msgstr "មិនមានព័ត៌មានបទចម្រៀង ឬតន្ត្រីទេ"

#. Translators: Spoken by the triple-press action before kicking off Shazam recognition, since no ICY track title was available to just copy.
#. Translators: Same as the What's Playing triple-press case, spoken before starting Shazam recognition.
#. Translators: Same as the Ctrl+Win+I triple-press case, spoken here by the F2 dialog equivalent before starting Shazam recognition.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:292
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:381
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:580
msgid "No track metadata found. Starting music recognition…"
msgstr "រកមិនឃើញទិន្នន័យមេតានៃបទចម្រៀង ឬតន្ត្រីទេ។ កំពុងចាប់ផ្តើមការស្គាល់តន្ត្រី…"

#. Translators: Spoken when the fourth press starts forced Shazam recognition, regardless of whether ICY metadata exists.
#. Translators: Same as elsewhere, spoken when this standalone gesture starts forced Shazam recognition.
#. Translators: Same as the Ctrl+Win+I fourth-press case, spoken here by the F2 dialog equivalent.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:315
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:410
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:600
msgid "Starting music recognition…"
msgstr "កំពុងចាប់ផ្តើមការស្គាល់តន្ត្រី…"

#. Equivalent to pressing Control+Windows+I (or F2 in the dialog) twice.
#. Opens the station details dialog for the currently playing station.
#. Provided as an unbound gesture so users who have difficulty with
#. rapid key presses can assign a single keystroke to this action.
#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; unbound-gesture equivalent of pressing Ctrl+Win+I (or F2 in the dialog) twice.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:324
msgid "Show details of the currently playing station"
msgstr "បង្ហាញព័ត៌មានលម្អិតនៃស្ថានីយ៍ដែលកំពុងចាក់"

#. Equivalent to pressing Control+Windows+I (or F2 in the dialog) three times.
#. Copies the current ICY track title to the clipboard, or starts Shazam
#. music recognition when no metadata is available.
#. Provided as an unbound gesture so users who have difficulty with
#. rapid key presses can assign a single keystroke to this action.
#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; unbound-gesture equivalent of pressing Ctrl+Win+I (or F2 in the dialog) three times.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:343
msgid ""
"Copy current track info to clipboard, or start music recognition if "
"unavailable"
msgstr "ចម្លងព័ត៌មានបទចម្រៀងបច្ចុប្បន្នទៅក្ដារតម្បៀតខ្ទាស់ ឬចាប់ផ្ដើមការស្គាល់តន្ត្រី ប្រសិនបើមិនមាន"

#. Equivalent to pressing Control+Windows+I (or F2 in the dialog) four times.
#. Forces Shazam music recognition regardless of whether ICY metadata is present.
#. Provided as an unbound gesture so users who have difficulty with
#. rapid key presses can assign a single keystroke to this action.
#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command; unbound-gesture equivalent of pressing Ctrl+Win+I (or F2 in the dialog) four times.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:392
msgid "Force music recognition for the currently playing stream"
msgstr "បង្ខំការស្គាល់តន្ត្រីសម្រាប់ស្ទ្រីមដែលកំពុងចាក់"

#. Translators: Field-name row header for the current ICY track title, when the station broadcasts one.
#. Translators: Same "Now playing" field-name row header as _build_radio_station_details, referenced here to check whether that row already exists in the dialog.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:747
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:1074
msgid "Now playing"
msgstr "ឥឡូវនេះកំពុងចាក់"

#. Translators: Field-name row header for the parent podcast feed's URL.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:836
msgid "Podcast"
msgstr "ផតខាស់"

#. Translators: Field-name row header for the resolved episode audio URL.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:852
msgid "Episode URL"
msgstr "URL ភាគ"

#. Translators: Field-name row header for a local jukebox file; value is the track title/filename.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:870
msgid "Track"
msgstr "បទ"

#. Translators: Field-name row header for the track's full file path.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:875
msgid "File"
msgstr "ឯកសារ"

#. Translators: Field-name row header for the track's file size.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:880
msgid "Size"
msgstr "ទំហំ"

#. Translators: Field-name row header for the track's duration.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:885
msgid "Duration"
msgstr "រយៈពេល"

#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\trackInfoMixin.py:895
#, python-format
